          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 75,
              "Title": "Tranquillity Facilities",
              "Text": "Discover tranquillity in our state-of-the-art spa facilities. Enjoy the warmth of the sauna, the detoxifying heat of the steam room and the soothing ambience of our relaxation lounge.\n\nGuests also have access to hydrotherapy pools and vitality showers. Changing rooms are equipped with lockers, towels and toiletries; please bring your spa robe from your room or purchase one at reception.\n\n![3948_5669e607f8.jpg](https://dedicated-bear-2ac79917c8.media.strapiapp.com/3948_5669e607f8_cec848c038.jpg)",
